    \ input_dir)\n      0242:     finally:\n      0243:         spark.stop()\n   \
    \   0244:     return {\"script_id\": \"sql_etl\", **result}\n      0245: \n  \
    \    0246: \n      0247: def run_drug_analysis(input_dir: Path, output_dir: Path)\
